# Dependencies are installed inside the image; never ship host node_modules
# (Windows npm creates .bin symlinks Docker's context loader rejects).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.gitignore
**/Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
compose*.yaml
**/README.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
apps/api/src/generated
